# Mock REO fragment — wires MockRewardsEligibilityOracle as RewardsManager's
# providerEligibilityOracle. Indexers self-toggle eligibility via the mock's
# setEligible(bool) call (signed from the indexer's own key); no off-chain
# oracle, no period mechanics. Tests that need eligibility as a binary
# precondition use this path.
#
# Set REO_MOCK=0 (or omit this fragment) to keep RewardsEligibilityOracleA
# wired (production-like). REO-A governance tests in tests/reo_governance.rs
# assume that mode.

REO_MOCK=1
